---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout>
  <section class="hero container">
    <div class="eyebrow">Find · Compare · Calculate · Decide</div>
    <h1>Practical standards and engineering tools for real purchasing decisions.</h1>
    <p>HowNote starts with fast calculators and size references, then connects standards comparison, compatibility analysis and sourcing checks.</p>
    <a class="button" href="/tools/pipe-weight-calculator">Open Pipe Weight Calculator</a>
  </section>
  <section class="container grid">
    <article class="card"><h2>Tools</h2><p class="muted">Calculate pipe weight, convert engineering units and move directly into relevant size and standards references.</p><a href="/tools">Browse tools →</a></article>
    <article class="card"><h2>Sizes</h2><p class="muted">Keep DN, NPS and regional aliases separate from actual OD, wall thickness and ID.</p><a href="/sizes">Browse sizes →</a></article>
    <article class="card"><h2>Standards</h2><p class="muted">Official metadata, edition status and evidence are labeled separately from calculated or inferred relationships.</p><a href="/standards">Browse standards →</a></article>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
